# #998 T7: one continuous zoom from L1 to the ground, along the demo journey.
# At each level the next marker on the journey, seen from toward its cell's
# centre: once as its preview grows in (40 gate radii), once just before
# it opens (10 gate radii; L6's large gate: 8 and 4). Then the planet from above and the ground.
# The first shot warms the draw pipelines and is not judged.
# name           level  where                                        look
